    "content": "<ul><li><p>Software Developer with<strong> 2.5+ years</strong> in game tech; fluent in <strong>C++,</strong> <strong>C#</strong></p></li><li><p>Specialized in <strong>locomotion</strong>, <strong>gameplay</strong>, <strong>animation</strong>, <strong>AI</strong> <strong>systems</strong>; experienced with <strong>Unity</strong> and <strong>proprietary C++ game engines</strong></p></li><li><p>Co-founded UwU Novels: created a Unity WebGL visual-novel engine, integrated cloud microservices, raised <strong>$19k</strong> seed funding, and grew the platform to <strong>500+ users</strong></p></li><li><p>Currently learning <strong>machine learning</strong>, <strong>real-time graphics</strong>, <strong>GPGPU</strong> programming</p></li></ul>"
  },
